UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C 530.A7 and .A11, expected misstatement has a direct relationship with sample size. As the expected amount of misstatement in the population increases, the auditor must examine more items to determine whether total actual misstatement exceeds tolerable misstatement.
